# Site is live — the temporary "coming soon" gate has been removed.
#
# There are intentionally no rules here now: every path serves its own
# file directly (the homepage at /, entries at /category/slug/, assets
# under /assets/, etc.), which is Cloudflare's default behavior for a
# static-asset Worker.
#
# The old coming-soon gate rewrote every URL to /coming-soon while the
# rest of the site was hidden before launch. To re-enable a gate later,
# restore a catch-all rewrite as the LAST rule, e.g.:
#   /*   /coming-soon   200
# with exact-path 200 passthroughs ABOVE it for every asset the gate
# page itself loads (styles.css, script.js, favicon, images), since
# Cloudflare stops at the first matching rule. See git history for the
# full working version.
#
# coming-soon.html is left in place (unlinked) so the gate can be
# restored without rebuilding it.
